<title>UK: Cookson group says buys Tiffany unit.</title>
<headline>Cookson group says buys Tiffany unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Cookson Group Plc said on Thursday that it had acquired the business and assets of Howard H Sweet &amp; Son Inc, a subsidiary of Tiffany &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The net asset value for the acquisitions was around 14 million stg, Cookson said in a statement.</p>
</text>
